<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>เว็บทดสอบของฉัน</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f2f5;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 400px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #1877f2;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        p {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .status {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background-color: #e7f3ff;
            color: #1877f2;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <h1>🎉 ยินดีด้วย!</h1>
        <p>เว็บไซต์ของคุณใช้งานบน GitHub Pages ได้แล้ว</p>
        <div class="status">Online 🟢</div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
